Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:51.92,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:56.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know animals are in miso soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:57.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:22:59.59,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon, Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.26,0:23:05.15,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,During Obon, when we went to visit grandpa's grave, the cicadas made a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.53,0:23:09.21,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,What? There's a bellflower by the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:11.57,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,When Daikichi saw that he started running.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:13.60,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:17.06,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Precious to Grandpa"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:19.33,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The answer is wa...kame! {here is a pun, because wakame is a kind of seaweed and kame is turtle}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:19.33,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Note: Wakame = Seaweed, Kame = Turtle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:07.19,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:10.61,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:12.31,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:15.93,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:19.18,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:22.58,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.13,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.63,0:01:34.39,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:38.94,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.64,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:45.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:48.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.97,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:55.19,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:58.50,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:05.19,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:08.63,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:16.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:07.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:10.61,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:12.31,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:15.93,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:19.18,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:22.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.13,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.63,0:01:34.39,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:38.73,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:45.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:48.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.97,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:55.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:58.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:05.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:08.63,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:16.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:52.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.37,0:21:02.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:07.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:17.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:22.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:27.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:32.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:38.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:42.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:48.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:53.43,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:22:02.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:52.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.37,0:21:02.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:07.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:17.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:22.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:27.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:32.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:38.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:42.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:48.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:53.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:22:02.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:07.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:08.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.20,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.12,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.96,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:29.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.30,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:34.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:35.43,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.14,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh. We came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:37.76,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.89,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:41.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, do you like sweet buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.27,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.98,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Round sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.23,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:48.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then Rin, pour some barley tea for Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:50.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Reina-chan, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You came right during snack time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.82,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna eat snacks, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.29,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:31.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:33.17,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've had it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.01,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:44.01,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. This is my first time here, but it's like Grandpa's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:45.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You bring a school satchel over on a Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:48.93,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:53.48,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, we... ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-wh-wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:56.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The folks at the house will worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:57.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:02.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it... uh... you know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is it what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You know. Your husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:10.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.00,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it something to do with having his parents there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:14.88,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's part of it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:20.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I guess living with your husband's parents is difficult...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.85,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if peaceful cohabitation between a wife and her in-laws even exists...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:28.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:32.52,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I have no brothers or sisters, and there's nowhere else for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:33.10,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}That's the arithmetic book we use, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:34.81,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stay here, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.81,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Let me see your other textbooks, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:38.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,F-First, let's talk things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:39.11,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Sure. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What about your in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:41.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Your Japanese book is different than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.45,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I left a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.57,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I wanna see yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:45.28,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't say where we were going, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:45.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Sure, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:47.70,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll take Reina to school...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:51.08,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Other than that, I haven't given it much thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.16,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't even told my parents yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't given it much thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You've got your daughter with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.13,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I had no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:01.72,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I just had to get out of that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.05,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't stand it another second!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:10.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, why don't we go grocery shopping for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:11.98,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:15.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything, but you can use the room on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.44,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It really is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.44,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. It's a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck did you cram in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:28.08,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers and textbooks are in there, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:30.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:37.42,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, usually you just make do with whatever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.50,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, tonight I'll cook you a decent meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I do not "just make do"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we look at the sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can each choose one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.30,Main Dialog,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.85,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of meat should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:53.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.14,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:54.89,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.44,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, this one's a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.07,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san! Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:07.07,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, this ground beef and pork combo is really cheap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:10.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:13.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... This isn't what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:16.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is Haruko, my cousin from my mother's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.13,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares what side I'm from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.92,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:21.96,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:28.47,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}My son is a classmate of Rin-chan, and I'm always obliged to Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell am I saying?! She didn't ask who it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:30.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I feel the need to explain it to her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.80,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Oh? Then my daughter is the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:32.60,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:32.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"This isn't what it looks like!" What was I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.64,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.43,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a first-grader this year, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.14,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.14,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:38.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of sweets did you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:41.52,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.57,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.65,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Deluxe Big Nyan Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:47.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting vegetable sponge cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:50.91,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting Meow Meow Kitty candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.87,Main Dialog,Moms,0000,0000,0000,,Are those really sweets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:04.30,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:09.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah, I suppose she's one of the more attractive moms...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:13.68,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think you should have an affair with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's absolutely nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, over there it's tough enough with just Kouki and her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so anything like that would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:22.61,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,"On her own"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:24.36,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}So during lunch at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:23.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Dope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You watch too many weird dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:27.61,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}A bug got out of its cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:28.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm guessing she's two or three years older than we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:30.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why would I care how old she is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:33.62,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So, is she divorced?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:41.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.34,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't had this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.34,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I experimented a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:49.05,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Usually, everything is made to my mother-in-law's taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.93,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, I want to have this at home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:58.02,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.14,Main Dialog,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:06:59.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:01.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.27,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.52,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Reina. Hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.69,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.36,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The floor creaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:11.32,Alt,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Reina. Use this towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.49,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:13.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.08,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,A bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.24,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:18.12,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't pull on it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did they fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.97,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.59,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It seems they were both excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:36.06,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I moved Rin-chan to your futon, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:37.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.06,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.31,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:43.81,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's been so long since I had alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Want something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:47.57,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I gain weight easily these days, so no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:51.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Then I have gained weight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:52.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I just meant now that we've hit our thirties...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:58.49,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd be happy just to be 30 again...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.70,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You can't act the same as when you were younger, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.46,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.96,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,On the other hand, my husband doesn't look at me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.05,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Who am I making an effort for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.05,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:19.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,While you were all taking a bath, I called your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:20.77,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.10,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do anything weird, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:24.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want everyone there to worry about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:31.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All I said was that you two are fine and are going to stay here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:33.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even give them my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.74,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I told you already, I left a note!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.74,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can do what you want, but there's Reina to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:45.29,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's with me and she's doing fine, so there's no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:51.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if that's true, if you don't tell them where you are and that Reina's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:55.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,how are the people who are waiting going to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:57.39,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about the people who are waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You need to be a little more level-headed about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you just want to make trouble for your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.47,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:07.06,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:07.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.94,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:20.08,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:25.87,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Even though they're married, but I always pretend like I'm sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.38,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's jumble up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:30.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.80,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's my cheek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:40.47,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Every day, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:45.68,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since I got married, I've been living with my feelings bottled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.81,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I think I deserve to cause them at least a little trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:55.57,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.40,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have said those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:58.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:00.74,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:10.42,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.19,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:30.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:44.45,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.00,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:50.12,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:52.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:54.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.55,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:59.42,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You have Rin-chan make breakfast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:01.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What do you think I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We always cook together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And when we use the stove, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.72,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Be nice to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.02,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you've got rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.69,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't take too long eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:18.99,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to school by train today...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.99,Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.61,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.41,Alt,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? This early in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.74,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:24.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:26.20,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:28.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're disturbing the neighbors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.91,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Is your school far, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:30.83,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You already have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:32.21,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:36.75,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's mom is busy, so he always comes over early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.17,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:43.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:45.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! She's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.22,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's that? Like I figured, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's "like I figured" supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:52.56,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, do you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I don't even know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:57.27,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, for you, single is better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:00.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "single"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.53,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know that one! "Divorce," right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:06.53,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know "divorce"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:11.41,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, your mom is married, but single is better for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:14.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're single, but is married better for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.71,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Adults really are weird, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:18.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They are, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:23.05,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:25.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You had breakfast before coming, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:26.35,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:29.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was supposed to be for me, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.02,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:34.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You didn't eat breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.85,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Why did you eat again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:36.61,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're good-natured to a fault, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:36.61,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:38.07,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I had one because I wanted one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:39.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What, because I gave him a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:39.11,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You're strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.23,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:41.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:44.45,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You must be just as busy as she is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:47.07,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You really must have a thing for that beautiful mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:50.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,St-Stu... Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.71,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought I could help her out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And Rin gets along with them, too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.51,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:07.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm pretty sure Kouki and his mother have been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:09.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It would be rude of me to be too forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:15.85,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It must be hard, being a woman on her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:22.23,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! I told you before, if you don't hurry up, you're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:20.32,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Mama always has just one piece of toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:20.73,Alt,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.03,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}She says she's on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:24.07,Main Dialog,Kid A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.90,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.86,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's a secret that we're staying with Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.66,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.79,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Because I said so! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:32.70,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.91,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.16,Main Dialog,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.33,Main Dialog,Friend B,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, did you come with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:38.92,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:42.46,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,We secretly ran away from home, so I came by train today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:44.80,Main Dialog,Friend A,0000,0000,0000,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.16,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.32,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.62,Main Dialog,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you to hold on to it tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.87,Main Dialog,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to get another one for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:21.96,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe it'll get home before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:25.46,Main Dialog,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe! Maybe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:32.97,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Have a nice evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:35.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're working late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.10,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my husband's watching him at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:38.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. How's Yuu-kun doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.10,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:43.36,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, he's so rambunctious these days, he's more than I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But it's nice that your husband helps out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.90,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:51.28,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,His business trip was suddenly rescheduled, so he has the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:55.83,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can rely on my husband to raise our kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.63,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan is waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:02.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:21.48,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're home! Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.53,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,They fell asleep right away tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't intend to make a big thing of this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.33,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean a divorce or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.21,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. That won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:51.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What the heck? I wasted time worrying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:54.39,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have thought about it a number of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:57.93,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I think about it almost every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:16:01.48,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, if I come to think of my husband as the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.52,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,while living in his family's house...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:07.82,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Except for Reina, they're all enemies to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.36,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I think of just the two of us as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:14.66,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But that isn't being realistic, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:18.62,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's Reina... and the question of my ability to earn a living...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.33,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And all the problems I'd have to face before I could reach that point...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:27.96,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,In my case, at the end of the day, it looks like I'm better off where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:31.76,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I got engaged soon after I joined the company...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:37.55,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When I was young, all I thought about was becoming a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.97,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I have no choice... do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:43.39,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And that's the only way I can protect Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:48.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I've never been married, but it seems like it's hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:50.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,even for a normal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.78,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, you do it all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.15,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:56.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I haven't been able to do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.83,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true. Rin-chan looks really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:03.04,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When she's cooking for you, for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:07.54,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and his mom are doing their best too, with just the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:10.21,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So Reina and I can hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:12.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All this "the two of us"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you talk to your husband about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.85,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, he works overtime every night and we never have a decent conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:22.27,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Reina and I will do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.27,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I've been putting up with it for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.10,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure I can keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:32.82,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I try to not feel anything, I can hold out, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds really unhealthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:37.11,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's just the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:38.78,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My health would be messed up if I {\i1}didn't{\i0} do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:43.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten stronger, Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:45.54,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm, I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.33,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After you give birth and raise a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:50.46,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,there are times when you need enormous strength, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.38,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Especially when they're still a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:57.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it's like with a baby, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:01.10,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And while you're keeping that up, for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:03.01,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You naturally become like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.48,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't want to be an old woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.81,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I never wanted to become strong, especially...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:16.19,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,If I could, I'd be a girl forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.16,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.16,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:25.12,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We'll go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:31.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is "marriage"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What does it mean to become a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:42.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:44.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.18,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:47.60,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:48.52,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:49.77,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:54.07,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's coming after he finishes his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.94,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You know he wouldn't be this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.90,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm positive it's Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.78,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:02.16,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not him, I say! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.87,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.62,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.58,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.54,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:15.88,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? So if he wants to get off work at this time, he can, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't put it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough working for a company, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.22,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stupid Hideyuki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.43,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.26,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko caused you so much trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:29.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, no... I didn't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:31.23,Main Dialog,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I really don't know what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm wearing the wrong clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:35.90,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.99,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You'd think Papa would at least carry our bags, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.49,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He's so inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.57,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I know! He's {\i1}inconsirit{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:50.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you ever feel like it, you can come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:53.63,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... I can't put you through more than I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No... That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:59.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is always saying that she wants to see Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:06.14,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you... Dai-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.01,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:09.39,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then can we come again on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:11.48,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,L-Listen, Reina...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:15.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When she was a girl, Haruko was a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:20.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, she mumbled that she wanted to stay a girl forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:23.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:26.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you come, why not pack a little lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:27.99,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I hate even looking at that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.20,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.37,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Girls always have a heavy load to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.17,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.04,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:37.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.01,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:13.77,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:17.35,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe this one suits you more, Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.35,0:22:18.27,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.27,0:22:20.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try this one on too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:21.31,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:22.94,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:25.36,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She just has to try this one on...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:27.99,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, don't you like this one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:31.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Kouki and I are going to wander around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:32.91,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.91,0:22:35.29,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,See, this one is really you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:34.33,Alt,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.21,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You look so cute, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:43.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:45.21,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:48.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.74,0:23:19.99,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(560,0)\pos(642,275)}Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.74,0:23:19.99,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(560,0)\an8\pos(642,440)}Precious to Grandpa
